        {
          "text": "These days it’s easy to make a film. You don’t need to 0 _____ expensive equipment, you can simply use your mobile phone. Start by 1 starting thinking going coming up with a good idea. You can 2 check figure look make out lists of ideas online to give you inspiration. A good script can make all the difference so before filming, your script should become the 3 attention focus target attraction of your time. Keep it simple and 4 work take bring try on developing one character well in the short time you have."
        },
        {
          "text": "Select appropriate venues for filming. Avoid places where you’ll be 5 contained grouped closed surrounded by people who turn and stare at the camera."
        },
        {
          "text": "Make sure there’s nothing unusual in the 6 window conditions background context to distract from what the main actor’s doing. And make sure the light is right. You want to give the 7 image attitude impression theory of depth, not have strange shadows covering the actor’s face. Finally, when you’ve finished filming and edited your work, show it to friends and get some feedback. No film-maker can 8 accomplish win overcome succeed in the film industry without that."
